# sandbox-ops: the operator tools of Cloud-Sandbox that provisioning does not take.
# Read by exportit/tools/export.py; described in exportit/MAP.md.
#
# Each file was read and marked in use, superseded or dead (stage 7, item 1);
# CATALOGUE.tsv in the unit gives the evidence for each. Tools in use go to
# bin/ (the mirror's public key to keys/). The superseded and dead files do
# not travel: by the operator's decision of 2026-11-13 the attic stays with the
# original repository, and cloud-sandbox.map takes them (stage 7, decision 2,
# reversed).

